  "subject": "🤖 AI Agents Daily — Europe Bets €3 Billion on Sovereign AI — and Regulated Banks Should Pay Attention | September 8, 2026",
  "htmlBody": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\">\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <meta name=\"x-apple-disable-message-reformatting\" />\n  <!--[if !mso]><!-->\n  <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\" />\n  <!--<![endif]-->\n  <title>🤖 AI Agents Daily — Europe Bets €3 Billion on Sovereign AI — and Regulated Banks Should Pay Attention | September 8, 2026</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f0f0f0;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;-ms-text-size-adjust:100%;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">\n\n<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ OUTER WRAPPER -->\n<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#f0f0f0\"\n       style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:24px 10px;\">\n\n      <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n      <table width=\"680\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\"><tr><td>\n      <![endif]-->\n\n      <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ MAIN CONTAINER -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"\n             style=\"max-width:680px;border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.10);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;\">\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── HEADER -->\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"\n              style=\"padding:40px 30px 28px 30px;border-bottom:2px solid #009c6d;\">\n\n            <!-- Logo emoji -->\n            <div style=\"font-size:40px;line-height:1;margin-bottom:12px;\">🤖</div>\n\n            <!-- Publication title -->\n            <h1 style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:30px;font-weight:bold;color:#1a1a1a;\n                        font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;letter-spacing:-0.5px;\n                        line-height:1.2;\">\n              AI Agents Daily\n            </h1>\n\n            <!-- Tagline -->\n            <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0;font-size:14px;color:#666666;\n                      font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.5;\">\n              AI developments that matter for financial institutions\n            </p>\n\n            <!-- Date -->\n            <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#999999;\n                      font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">\n              September 8, 2026\n            </p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ──────────────────────────────────────── DEEP DIVE SECTION -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:40px 30px 0 30px;\">\n\n            <!-- Section header -->\n            <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 22px 0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;\n                        font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.3;\">\n              Deep Dive 🔍\n            </h2>\n\n            <!-- Deep dive article title -->\n            <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 18px 0;font-size:21px;font-weight:bold;color:#1a1a1a;\n                        font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;line-height:1.4;\">\n              Europe Bets €3 Billion on Sovereign AI — and Regulated Banks Should Pay Attention\n            </h3>\n\n            <!-- Deep dive article body (HTML from Claude, inline-styled by email-builder) -->\n            <div style=\"font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;\n                        font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">\n              <h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 10px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding-bottom:8px;\">Overview</h3><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\"><a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidEFVX3lxTFBYc1JreGFMNEJfaE5NN2EzV2ZoRVJIbnlsbkxRS2hWNzhJMVJDMDlDeXdvSG9LYm5pZURCS1VuU1hlVkpiZzgzUkZ1c1dyNDAwYkxqb0QwVmxBeHhheVY1WkNNUGpDSmQ1Z19KSHc4ZzRTRlAw?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:none;\">Mistral AI just closed Europe's largest-ever AI funding round at €3 billion</a>, with Samsung as a lead partner, and the centrepiece isn't another cloud API. It's <strong>on-premise sovereign AI</strong> — designed for organisations that cannot let data leave their walls. That describes most regulated banks.</p><h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 10px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding-bottom:8px;\">The Details</h3><ul style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0 0 0 20px;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">€3 billion raised — Europe's largest-ever AI funding round by a significant margin</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Samsung leads the round and partners with Mistral for semiconductor-focused, on-premise AI deployment</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">\"Sovereign AI\" means models run inside the customer's own infrastructure — no data transits external servers</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Directly targets sectors with strict data-residency requirements: finance, defence, and government</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Positions Mistral as the credible European alternative to US hyperscalers for compliance-sensitive AI</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Reinforces Europe's push for AI independence amid ongoing uncertainty about transatlantic data flows</li></ul><h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 10px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding-bottom:8px;\">Why It Matters</h3><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">For European and APAC banks navigating GDPR, banking secrecy laws, and regulators' growing scepticism about routing customer data to US cloud infrastructure, Mistral's sovereign AI stack is the most credible on-premise frontier-model option to emerge. The choice is no longer <em style=\"color:#333333;\">cloud AI or nothing</em> — it's a genuine three-way decision between US hyperscalers, regulated private cloud, and on-premise sovereign AI.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">The Samsung partnership isn't window dressing. It gives Mistral enterprise hardware distribution at industrial scale and signals serious long-term intent from a global electronics giant. <strong>Banks evaluating AI vendor risk</strong> should now track Mistral as a strategic alternative — not just for European regulatory comfort, but as competitive leverage when negotiating terms with OpenAI, Google, and Microsoft.</p>\n            </div>\n\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── DIVIDER: Deep Dive → Things to Know -->\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:36px 0;\">\n            <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n            <table width=\"340\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\"><tr>\n            <td height=\"3\" bgcolor=\"#009c6d\" style=\"font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td>\n            </tr></table>\n            <![endif]-->\n            <!--[if !mso]><!-->\n            <div style=\"width:50%;height:3px;background-color:#009c6d;margin:0 auto;\"></div>\n            <!--<![endif]-->\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── THINGS TO KNOW SECTION -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 30px 0 30px;\">\n\n            <!-- Section header -->\n            <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 22px 0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;\n                        font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.3;\">\n              Things to Know 👀\n            </h2>\n\n            <!-- Things to Know entries injected by email-builder -->\n            \n      <!-- TTK entry 1 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            1. <strong>Google Cloud Debuts Gemini Enterprise for Financial Services to Power Agentic Workflows</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxOaTRwR3RfWmRlcjRXM245RG5nVzZmMWF2WUgwdmFzbWJvS0FMTTR6cVhzQ0NRQ2VCODIxeUVIMG56cFJDeHNRbVB0WjlUV1oyX3NzS3ZrQTJTeGtwemdCVlpheG4yaXhTcFRLaE9iRkVvdGdjY2Fkc3hZd0ZPTGd4aWE4VG9VWDRyb2cwdGpINlhpOVBDVGRTdFZicV9Hd2xHNFgtLWZrV1JTWXlNMERydmk0MWh5Um8?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">The Fintech Times</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Google Cloud launched Gemini Enterprise for Financial Services, embedding Gemini's agentic capabilities directly into banking and insurance workflows — targeting compliance monitoring, risk analysis, and client-service automation for regulated institutions.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Hyperscaler targeting goes vertical:</strong> Google is now selling a financial-services-specific product tier directly to bank CIOs, narrowing the gap between general AI platforms and the regulated-industry deployment requirements that have kept adoption cautious.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 2 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            2. <strong>Kyndryl and Google Cloud wrap agentic onboarding PoC via Incore Bank</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxNS3Z0QWQyYmVJS0haRE5WZ3ZHWXA4VkJPQmVnWjB3MVB1NGc3aDhIbzN2Z0tLam5HRC1tMHVDSTZSbmxvSVN5TnhfTlYwcnd4WVh5cDZKTU0xeWZXdl9GYnp4S1BFTGlub21vbFczdkMtTVVLVWJEbGZ3R3NNUzhyNEpBcWVwS0M0S1VKcHExRTd0ZlB3SEJIRklfUmZUVE1mUVVvWVctQS1tcEs4cVoxQkQ1QTh5X0pwVDA0UDA1aDFHbUkzWXVqT1VR?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">FinTech Futures</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Kyndryl and Google Cloud completed an agentic AI proof-of-concept for customer onboarding at Incore Bank, demonstrating end-to-end automated document processing, KYC verification, and account setup using AI agents.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>PoC-to-production signal:</strong> A completed bank onboarding PoC from two enterprise-grade vendors challenges the &quot;still just demos&quot; narrative — onboarding is one of banking's costliest and most friction-heavy workflows.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 3 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            3. <strong>Cognition AI raises $2 billion at $48 billion valuation</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxPc3hsV1U1MTdYTkgwaHJhanppVTU1cUZVLW94amhlM3liQjE1SUVFdnJtRFlvcExWRkI5RURMMllzd1djSlhUT09VTGotRHhFZm1NTmdDTXpEYmdNaVhITU1STXdTSVE3NlhQVVAySTE1WUVhXzZSZzdSUl9DRVlmVWVpaEl0cXR5ZzBjYUZlaDRzbkVfSFllNVJEOWlHQQ?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">Reuters</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Cognition AI, maker of Devin the autonomous AI software engineer, raised $2 billion at a $48 billion valuation in a Series E — one of the largest VC rounds of 2026 and a landmark validation of agentic AI as a mature enterprise category.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Build-vs-buy decision accelerates:</strong> At $48B, Cognition's valuation signals the market believes autonomous coding agents will be core infrastructure. Banks with large tech estates should evaluate whether they become customers — or get left behind.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 4 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            4. <strong>GPT-6 Astra: A new generation of intelligence</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiTkFVX3lxTE11QUxBUVJLdC1jSmtJbmcxQzg4Qm9yUlNPS3JEMEVBanIyY1FRT2k2R0hBTlNnX2VqcWpTSDJUMDV0TjBJN1VGamlrZzVPZw?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">OpenAI</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            OpenAI launched GPT-6 Astra with tiered pricing at $10 and $50 per month, marking a significant generational capability leap and resetting the cost and performance benchmarks for enterprise AI deployments.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Model refresh decision point:</strong> GPT-6 Astra's launch means financial institutions running AI on GPT-4/5-class models should immediately benchmark the uplift against their use cases — and model the cost delta before it becomes a competitive gap.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 5 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            5. <strong>What A Wealth Manager Learned From Testing Agentic AI On Its Own Data Backlog</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxNZGtXQjFFcmVfb2dBdndwVHh3dVN4YVg1NUJzUXg1Y29ISDQ2MlpvZU1fSlhxeFZmWWR3WVFjUXVBa2tORWxqMmdPcVRnUHlCN01xazc2OGUwN1UyLVNkM0Nyc0JZckNUV2xyYW41REVDMURtWm0tS09GZlVHSklaekRTR0FIWTRTaG9VdmgzaEpmd2dCVnNrRTdyX3hYY21TUnZZd3UyMG1zSU53MGx4blBVT0twMGY5dWc?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">Global Banking &amp; Finance Review</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            A wealth management firm ran a live agentic AI test against its own historical data backlog, surfacing insights on where autonomous agents succeeded, where they hallucinated, and what human oversight controls proved necessary in production.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Grounded evidence beats vendor demos:</strong> First-person accounts from practitioners testing agentic AI on real financial data are far more valuable for risk assessments than benchmark reports — this case study is worth sharing with your risk and innovation teams.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Spacer after last entry -->\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:4px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── DIVIDER: Things to Know → Startups -->\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:36px 0;\">\n            <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n            <table width=\"340\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\"><tr>\n            <td height=\"3\" bgcolor=\"#009c6d\" style=\"font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td>\n            </tr></table>\n            <![endif]-->\n            <!--[if !mso]><!-->\n            <div style=\"width:50%;height:3px;background-color:#009c6d;margin:0 auto;\"></div>\n            <!--<![endif]-->\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── AGENTIC STARTUPS SECTION -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 30px 0 30px;\">\n\n            <!-- Section header -->\n            <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 22px 0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;\n                        font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.3;\">\n              Agentic Startups to Watch 🚀\n            </h2>\n\n            <!-- Startup entries injected by email-builder -->\n            \n      <!-- Startup entry 1 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Company name + tagline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            <strong>1. <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxOd052VDBaM2c2c2ZEOU1fN05ZOE4xRU5Wd1VCandndmlRWm0taDZ2T3VoQWtfb2JOSmZSaFlIcmRZOHBCX05WMXliT096eGczTVhnTE9TalVwaVhmZTE5VkdUQm0zQnJ6RG5KamE4end6Ul80TUNIdDNEeWNuNDNfZEhPTDA4dktnZUpYWDVqSGlKOFlKbl9qWmxB?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:none;\">GenHealth.ai</a></strong> &mdash; <strong>AI agents that automate back-office administrative workflows across healthcare and insurance operations</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            GenHealth.ai closed a $16.5 million Series A to scale its AI agent platform, which automates prior authorisation, claims processing, and clinical documentation — cutting administrative overhead for health system back-offices.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Analysis bullet -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:10px 